## Disaster Recovery & Business Continuity

- **RTO (Recovery Time Objective)**: < 15 minutes
- **RPO (Recovery Point Objective)**: < 1 hour
- **Backup Frequency**: Daily automated snapshots
- **Backup Retention**: 30 days
- **Failover**: Automatic with ALB health checks
- **Multi-Region**: Optional secondary region setup (documented separately)

## Performance Targets

- **API Response Time**: < 200ms (p95)
- **Dashboard Load Time**: < 2 seconds
- **Shipment Processing Latency**: < 5 seconds
- **Rate Calculation**: < 3 seconds
- **Uptime SLA**: 99.9%

